      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Plank jacks</td>
        <td>45 seconds</td>
        <td>From plank position</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Dead bugs</td>
        <td>45 seconds</td>
        <td>Controlled movement</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Jumping jacks</td>
        <td>30 seconds</td>
        <td>Cool-down pace</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Progression Without Equipment</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Increase time under tension (3 seconds down, 1 second up)</li>
    <li>Reduce rest periods between exercises</li>
    <li>Add isometric holds at peak contraction</li>
    <li>Combine movements into flows</li>
    <li>Increase total circuit rounds</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Nutrition Support</h2>
  <p>Match your nutrition to your training using our tools. Calculate your <a href="/">daily calorie needs</a> and <a href="/protein-calculator/">protein target</a> to support recovery and results.</p>

  <h2>Tracking Your Progress</h2>
  <p>Record your workout duration, circuit rounds completed, and how you felt. Notice improvements in energy, strength, and body composition over 4-6 weeks of consistent practice.</p>

  <p>Ready for more? Also see our <a href="/workouts/all-in-one-exercise/7-exercises/">7 exercises to do every day</a> and <a href="/workouts/all-in-one-exercise/10-exercises/">10 best home exercises</a>.</p>
</ContentLayout>